# =============================================================================
# Rust / Tauri
# =============================================================================
target/
app/desktop/src-tauri/target/

# Desktop Tauri generated:
# - gen/schemas/* may be regenerated by Tauri; keep tracked only if CI/capabilities need them
# - gen/android/* is NOT product source (Mobile mainline is app/mobile-rn). Local noise only.
# - 实测结论（勿取消跟踪）：gen/schemas/* 由 `tauri dev`/`tauri build` 重新生成，
#   但有两处硬消费者——app/desktop/src-tauri/capabilities/default.json 的 $schema 引用
#   （编辑器校验），以及 scripts/release/verify-tauri-package-readiness.py 的
#   assert_generated_schema_clean（release-readiness.yml readiness-policy 与 tauri package
#   dry 门禁，要求目录存在、含 desktop-schema.json/windows-schema.json 且 git 干净）。
app/desktop/src-tauri/gen/android/

